# The two suites that read the private model this tool was developed against. They skip
# themselves everywhere else, so nobody loses coverage by not having them — but they are
# written against a real report, so they name its tables, measures and BigQuery project.
# That belongs on the maintainer's disk, not in a public repository.
/packages/core/tests/realProject.test.js
/apps/web/tests/realFolder.test.js

# Generated output. These carry a full copy of whatever model produced them — including
# server hostnames and every table name — so they must never reach a commit.
/out/
*.handoff.html
/handoff.html
/MODEL.md
/model.json
/demo.html
